      "extract": "\\label{sec:facts} Let $\\K$ be a field of characteristic $0$. Given $\\K$-modules $V, W$ we write $V \\otimes W$ and $\\opn{Hom}(V, W)$ instead of $V \\otimes_{\\K} W$ and $\\opn{Hom}_{\\K}(V, W)$, respectively. \\begin{dfn} By {\\em parameter algebra} over $\\K$ we mean a complete noetherian local commutative $\\K$-algebra $R$, with maximal ideal $\\m$, such that $R / \\m = \\K$. We call $\\m$ a {\\em parameter ideal}. \\end{dfn}",
